  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1226061,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 18th +39 +HI: A Commodore 64 Adventure\n\nVenture into the perilous world of 18th century Bohemia in *18th +39 +HI*, a text adventure for the Commodore 64. You are a young nobleman, falsely accused of treason and sentenced to exile in the remote, snow-swept mountains. Your only hope for redemption lies in uncovering the true conspirators and clearing your name.\n\nNavigate treacherous landscapes, solve intricate puzzles, and interact with a cast of memorable characters – from cunning merchants to enigmatic monks – as you unravel a web of political intrigue and ancient secrets. The game boasts a sophisticated parser, allowing for nuanced commands and realistic interactions. \n\nPrepare for a challenging experience; survival depends on your wit, observation, and careful resource management.  *18th +39 +HI* combines a compelling narrative with demanding gameplay, offering a richly detailed and immersive journey into a bygone era. Can you expose the plot and reclaim your honor, or will you succumb to the harsh realities of the Bohemian wilderness?"
    },
